/**
 * Right-side peek pane. Renders alongside the main content inside the owner
 * layout: when a peek item is open, the layout splits (main shrinks left, this
 * pane shows right). The body mounts the SAME content component the dedicated
 * page uses (see PeekPaneContent) — no duplication. Closes via the X or when
